delines for research, audit, and publication</article-title><source>BMJ</source><volume>312</volume><fpage>1094</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8616423</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040288-b011"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Kaplan</surname><given-names>JB</given-names></name><name><surname>Bennett</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>Use of race and ethnicity in biomedical publication</article-title><source>JAMA</source><volume>289</volume><fpage>2709</fpage><lpage>2716</lpage><comment>Erratum: (2004) 292: 1022</comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12771118</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040288-b012"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Winker</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>Measuring race and ethnicity: Why or how?</article-title><source>JAMA</source><volume>292</volume><fpage>1612</fpage><lpage>1614</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15467065</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040288-b013"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group><name><surname>Iverson</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Christiansen</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Flanagin</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Fontanarosa</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Glass</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2007</year><source>AMA manual of style</source><edition>10th edition</edition><publisher-loc>New York</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Oxford University Press; American Medical Association</publisher-name><fpage>1010</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040288-b014"><citation citation-type="book"><collab>Council of Science Editors Style Manual Committee</collab><year>2006</year><source>Scientific style and format: The CSE manual for authors, editors, and publishers</source><edition>7th edition</edition><publisher-loc>Reston (VA)</publisher-loc><publisher-name>The Council</publisher-name><fpage>658</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040288-b015"><citation citation-type="book"><collab>International Committee of Medical Journal Editors</collab><year>2006</year><source>Uniform requirements for manuscripts submitted to biomedical journals: Writing and editing for biomedical publication</source><publisher-loc>Philadelphia (PA)</publisher-loc><publisher-name>ICJME</publisher-name><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.icmje.org/">http://www.icmje.org/</ext-link>. Accessed 3 July 2007</comment></citation></ref></ref-list><fn-group><fn id="n1" fn-type="current-aff"><p>The <italic>PLoS Medicine Editors</italic> are Virginia Barbour, Barbara Cohen, Paul Chinnock, Larry Peiperl, and Gavin Yamey.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>